EDCP Context Haystack
=====================

This dataset is a benchmark input artifact. It contains excerpts of source code
diffs and documentation used as a context haystack for the EDCP benchmark.

Source
------

  Repository:  https://github.com/dlt-hub/dlt
  Commit:      see MANIFEST.json -> corpus_commit
  License:     Apache License 2.0 (see LICENSE)
  Copyright:   dlt-hub and dlt contributors

Modifications
-------------

Excerpts were selected and concatenated by an automated build script. No file
contents were edited. The following were excluded:

  - files carrying agent instructions (AGENTS.md, CLAUDE.md, CONTRIBUTING.md)
  - the repository's AI-harness and agent documentation trees
  - any excerpt containing agent-instruction or coding-standards language

MANIFEST.json records every included source path and commit, the token estimate,
and the exclusion rules applied, so the artifact can be regenerated and audited
from the pinned commit.

